<div class="notification-grid"><section class="queue-card"><div class="queue-card-header"><div><div class="section-title-row"><h2><i class="bi bi-bag-check text-success me-2"></i>Cucian siap diambil</h2><span class="table-count"><?= count($ready) ?></span></div><p>Order yang sudah selesai diproses dan menunggu pelanggan.</p></div></div><?php if(!$ready): ?><div class="notification-empty"><i class="bi bi-check-circle"></i><strong>Belum ada cucian siap diambil</strong></div><?php else: foreach($ready as $o): ?><div class="notice-row"><span class="notice-symbol ready-symbol"><i class="bi bi-bag-check"></i></span><div class="notice-main"><strong><?= e($o['customer']) ?> · <?= e($o['code']) ?></strong><span><?= e($o['package']) ?> · <?= e($o['weight']) ?> kg · Deadline <?= e(deadlineLabel($o['deadline'])) ?></span></div><a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" href="edit.php?code=<?= urlencode($o['code']) ?>">Perbarui</a></div><?php endforeach;endif; ?></section>
<section class="queue-card"><div class="queue-card-header"><div><div class="section-title-row"><h2><i class="bi bi-clock-history text-danger me-2"></i>Deadline terlewat</h2><span class="table-count"><?= count($overdue) ?></span></div><p>Order aktif yang sudah melewati estimasi selesai.</p></div></div><?php if(!$overdue): ?><div class="notification-empty"><i class="bi bi-calendar-check"></i><strong>Tidak ada deadline terlewat</strong></div><?php else: foreach($overdue as $o): ?><div class="notice-row"><span class="notice-symbol overdue-symbol"><i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle"></i></span><div class="notice-main"><strong><?= e($o['customer']) ?> · <?= e($o['code']) ?></strong><span><?= e(statusLabel($o['status'])) ?> · Deadline <?= e(deadlineLabel($o['deadline'])) ?></span></div><a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" href="edit.php?code=<?= urlencode($o['code']) ?>">Periksa</a></div><?php endforeach;endif; ?></section></div>
<section class="queue-card mt-4"><div class="queue-card-header"><div><div class="section-title-row"><h2>Aktivitas terbaru</h2><span class="table-count"><?= count($notices) ?></span></div><p>Aktivitas yang tercatat selama sesi demo ini.</p></div></div><?php if(!$notices): ?><div class="notification-empty"><i class="bi bi-inbox"></i><strong>Belum ada aktivitas baru</strong><span>Aktivitas order baru dan perubahan status akan muncul di sini.</span></div><?php else: foreach(array_reverse($notices) as $n): ?><div class="notice-row"><span class="notice-symbol"><i class="bi bi-bell"></i></span><div class="notice-main"><strong><?= e($n['message']) ?></strong><span><?= e($n['code']) ?> · <?= e(date('d/m/Y H:i',strtotime($n['time']))) ?></span></div></div><?php endforeach;endif; ?></section>
<div class="demo-note mt-3"><i class="bi bi-info-circle-fill"></i><span>Halaman ini adalah notifikasi internal di aplikasi. Pengiriman WhatsApp belum diaktifkan dan memerlukan integrasi gateway di backend.</span></div><?php require __DIR__.'/includes/footer.php'; ?>
